# Source video originals. The hero loop shipped to the site is hero.mp4
# (7.4MB, 1280w CRF32); the 4K masters it was encoded from are not tracked.
*.mp4
!hero.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# Design sources and unused variants the site never references. All of
# these stay on disk locally, they just aren't tracked.
knot-landing.svg
knot-landing.png
knot-logo-teal.png

# Hero photograph masters. The site only ever loads the derived
# -780/-1280/-1920 .webp and .jpg next to them; the masters are here to
# re-derive from, not to ship.
#   hero.jpg      9120x5130, 7.5MB  (Unsplash / Johannes Plenio) - the hero
#   hero-2.jpg    3840x2160, 1.1MB  (Unsplash / Firli S) - the closing band
#   pricing-2.jpg 6000x4000, 6.9MB  (Unsplash / Dillon Fancher) - pricing card
hero.jpg
hero-2.jpg

# Screenshot / render tooling. The typography pass drove headless Chrome
# from a scratch dir outside the repo; these patterns are here so the
# artefacts stay untracked if that ever runs in-tree.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
before/
after/
